#. The Activities screen: a screen's title, top left; about 96 pixels in the title font
msgctxt "hub.activities-title"
msgid "My Activities"
msgstr "Моите дейности"

#. The Activities screen when there are none: a message centred on the screen; about 160 pixels a line
msgctxt "hub.no-activities"
msgid "No activities"
msgstr "Няма дейности"

#. The device list: a screen's title, top left; about 96 pixels in the title font
msgctxt "hub.devices-title"
msgid "Devices"
msgstr "Устройства"

#. The device list when there are none: a message centred on the screen; about 160 pixels a line
msgctxt "hub.no-devices"
msgid "No devices"
msgstr "Няма устройства"

#. Opens Options: a softkey label, bottom of the screen; about 70 pixels
msgctxt "softkey.options"
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Опции"

#. Back to Activities: a softkey label, bottom of the screen; about 70 pixels
msgctxt "softkey.activities"
msgid "Activities"
msgstr "Дейности"

#. Opens the device list: a softkey label, bottom of the screen; about 70 pixels
msgctxt "softkey.devices"
msgid "Devices"
msgstr "Устройства"

#. Back to the activity that is running, from the device list and a device's screens: a softkey label, bottom of the screen; about 70 pixels
msgctxt "softkey.current-activity"
msgid "Current Activity"
msgstr "Текуща дейност"

#. After a screen's page total, e.g. '1/3 pages', in the small counter font; about 40 pixels
msgctxt "pages"
msgid "page"
msgid_plural "pages"
msgstr[0] "страница"
msgstr[1] "страници"

#. While an activity starts, under its icon; {activity} is its name. Two lines at most, of about 164 pixels, then cut
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "activity.starting"
msgid "Starting {activity}"
msgstr "Стартиране: {activity}"

#. While an activity starts or Help is fixing it, at the bottom: a message centred on the screen; about 160 pixels a line; two lines at most
msgctxt "activity.keep-pointed"
msgid "Keep the remote pointed at your system."
msgstr "Дръжте дистанционното насочено към системата."

#. Help, under the activity's name, while it re-sends what the activity needs: a message centred on the screen; about 160 pixels a line
msgctxt "activity.fixing"
msgid "Attempting to fix the problem..."
msgstr "Опит за отстраняване на проблема..."

#. The title of Help when nothing is running, while it turns everything off again: a screen's title, top left; about 96 pixels in the title font
msgctxt "activity.power-off"
msgid "Power Off"
msgstr "Изключване"

#. On an activity's favourite channels, opens its commands: a softkey label, bottom of the screen; about 70 pixels
msgctxt "softkey.commands"
msgid "Commands"
msgstr "Команди"

#. On an activity's commands, opens its favourite channels: a softkey label, bottom of the screen; about 70 pixels
msgctxt "softkey.favourites"
msgid "Favorites"
msgstr "Любими"

#. Help, at the bottom while it re-sends: a message centred on the screen; about 160 pixels a line; two lines
msgctxt "help.keep-pointed"
msgid "Keep the remote pointed to your system."
msgstr "Дръжте дистанционното насочено към системата."

#. Help's first question, after it has re-sent everything; a line break starts the explanation below it: a message centred on the screen; about 160 pixels a line
msgctxt "help.fixed-first"
msgid "Did that fix the problem?\nIf not, the remote will ask you questions to help correct the problem."
msgstr "Това реши ли проблема?\nАко не, дистанционното ще ви зададе въпроси, за да го отстрани."

#. Help, after a device answered: a message centred on the screen; about 160 pixels a line
msgctxt "help.fixed"
msgid "Did that fix the problem?"
msgstr "Това реши ли проблема?"

#. Help asks about each device an activity turns on; {device} is its name: a message centred on the screen; about 160 pixels a line; three lines at most
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "assistant.is-on"
msgid "Is the {device} on?"
msgstr "Включено ли е {device}?"

#. Help asks again after sending its power: a message centred on the screen; about 160 pixels a line
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "assistant.now-on"
msgid "Now is the {device} on?"
msgstr "А сега включено ли е {device}?"

#. Help asks about each input; {device} and {input} are names: a message centred on the screen; about 160 pixels a line; three lines at most
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "assistant.input"
msgid "Is the {device} set to the {input} input?"
msgstr "Настроено ли е {device} на входа {input}?"

#. Help asks again after sending the input: a message centred on the screen; about 160 pixels a line
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "assistant.now-input"
msgid "Now is the {device} set to the {input} input?"
msgstr "А сега настроено ли е {device} на входа {input}?"

#. Off's Help asks about each device: a message centred on the screen; about 160 pixels a line
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "assistant.is-off"
msgid "Is the {device} off?"
msgstr "Изключено ли е {device}?"

#. Off's Help asks again after turning it off: a message centred on the screen; about 160 pixels a line
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "assistant.now-off"
msgid "Now is the {device} off?"
msgstr "А сега изключено ли е {device}?"

#. An answer, bottom left: a softkey label, bottom of the screen; about 70 pixels
msgctxt "softkey.yes"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Да"

#. An answer, bottom right: a softkey label, bottom of the screen; about 70 pixels
msgctxt "softkey.no"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Не"

#. Closes a Remote Assistant note, bottom right: a softkey label, bottom of the screen; about 70 pixels
msgctxt "softkey.ok"
msgid "OK"
msgstr "OK"

#. The Remote Assistant's screens: the activity's name, or Off's, as their title: a screen's title, top left; about 96 pixels in the title font
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "assistant.title"
msgid "{name}:"
msgstr "{name}:"

#. Above each Remote Assistant note: a message centred on the screen; about 160 pixels a line
msgctxt "assistant.heading"
msgid "Remote Assistant:"
msgstr "Помощник:"

#. After an activity starts: a message centred on the screen; about 160 pixels a line
msgctxt "assistant.press-help"
msgid "If any devices are not set up correctly, press \"Help\" now."
msgstr "Ако някое устройство не е настроено правилно, натиснете \"Help\" сега."

#. After an activity starts, once Remote Assistant is back on: a message centred on the screen; about 160 pixels a line
msgctxt "assistant.set-up"
msgid "The remote has now set up your system for this Activity."
msgstr "Дистанционното настрои системата ви за тази дейност."

#. Above Yes and No: a message centred on the screen; about 160 pixels a line
msgctxt "assistant.hide"
msgid "Do you want to hide the Remote Assistant?"
msgstr "Да скрия ли помощника?"

#. After choosing to hide it: a message centred on the screen; about 160 pixels a line
msgctxt "assistant.how-to-hide"
msgid "To hide the remote assistant, use the software to update the display settings for your remote."
msgstr "За да скриете помощника, променете настройките на дисплея на дистанционното от програмата."

#. The first note a new remote shows, when it starts: a message centred on the screen; about 160 pixels a line
msgctxt "assistant.welcome"
msgid "Welcome to your remote."
msgstr "Добре дошли във вашето дистанционно."

#. After Off: a message centred on the screen; about 160 pixels a line
msgctxt "assistant.all-off"
msgid "Ensure all your devices are off.  If any devices are still on, press \"Help\" now."
msgstr "Уверете се, че всички устройства са изключени.  Ако някое е още включено, натиснете \"Help\" сега."

#. An Options row while the Remote Assistant asks after each start: a row label, centred on a 164-pixel row
msgctxt "options.assistant-off"
msgid "Turn Remote Assistant Off"
msgstr "Изключи помощника"

#. An Options row while it does not: a row label, centred on a 164-pixel row
msgctxt "options.assistant-on"
msgid "Turn Remote Assistant On"
msgstr "Включи помощника"

#. An Options row: a row label, centred on a 164-pixel row
msgctxt "options.tutorial"
msgid "Tutorial"
msgstr "Ръководство"

#. The Tutorial's screens: a screen's title, top left; about 96 pixels in the title font
msgctxt "tutorial.title"
msgid "Tutorial"
msgstr "Ръководство"

#. Leaves the Tutorial: a softkey label, bottom of the screen; about 70 pixels
msgctxt "softkey.exit"
msgid "Exit"
msgstr "Изход"

#. A Tutorial page, from the left, about 160 pixels a line; a line break starts a new paragraph. The last paragraph says which key moves on.
msgctxt "tutorial.1"
msgid "Welcome to your Harmony One touch-screen remote. Touch the screen to learn more."
msgstr "Добре дошли в тъч дистанционното Harmony One. Докоснете екрана, за да научите повече."

#. A Tutorial page, from the left, about 160 pixels a line; a line break starts a new paragraph. The last paragraph says which key moves on.
msgctxt "tutorial.2"
msgid "Use the arrow buttons on the sides of this screen to move between pages.\nPress the right arrow now."
msgstr "Използвайте стрелките отстрани на екрана, за да преминавате между страниците.\nНатиснете дясната стрелка сега."

#. A Tutorial page, from the left, about 160 pixels a line; a line break starts a new paragraph. The last paragraph says which key moves on.
msgctxt "tutorial.3"
msgid "The Harmony remote uses Activities to give you simple one-touch control of your entertainment system.\nPress the Activities button now."
msgstr "Дистанционното Harmony използва дейности, за да управлявате системата си с едно докосване.\nНатиснете бутона \"Activities\" сега."

#. A Tutorial page, from the left, about 160 pixels a line; a line break starts a new paragraph. The last paragraph says which key moves on.
msgctxt "tutorial.4"
msgid "Activities are what you actually do with your entertainment system, like watch TV or listen to music.\nTouch Watch TV now."
msgstr "Дейностите са това, което правите със системата си - например гледате телевизия или слушате музика.\nДокоснете \"Телевизия\" сега."

#. A Tutorial page, from the left, about 160 pixels a line; a line break starts a new paragraph. The last paragraph says which key moves on.
msgctxt "tutorial.5"
msgid "Selecting the Watch TV Activity turns on the devices you use to watch TV.\nPress the right arrow to continue."
msgstr "Дейността \"Телевизия\" включва устройствата, с които гледате телевизия.\nНатиснете дясната стрелка, за да продължите."

#. A Tutorial page, from the left, about 160 pixels a line; a line break starts a new paragraph. The last paragraph says which key moves on.
msgctxt "tutorial.6"
msgid "Look on the screen for functions you can't find elsewhere on the remote.\nPress the right arrow to continue."
msgstr "На екрана ще намерите функции, които ги няма другаде на дистанционното.\nНатиснете дясната стрелка, за да продължите."

#. A Tutorial page, from the left, about 160 pixels a line; a line break starts a new paragraph. The last paragraph says which key moves on.
msgctxt "tutorial.7"
msgid "To select another Activity, simply press the Activities button.\nPress the right arrow to continue."
msgstr "За да изберете друга дейност, просто натиснете бутона \"Activities\".\nНатиснете дясната стрелка, за да продължите."

#. A Tutorial page, from the left, about 160 pixels a line; a line break starts a new paragraph. The last paragraph says which key moves on.
msgctxt "tutorial.8"
msgid "Use the Help button if your Activity doesn't start properly.\nPress Help now."
msgstr "Използвайте бутона \"Help\", ако дейността не стартира правилно.\nНатиснете \"Help\" сега."

#. A Tutorial page, from the left, about 160 pixels a line; a line break starts a new paragraph. The last paragraph says which key moves on.
msgctxt "tutorial.9"
msgid "Help asks you questions to get your Activity back on track. Press the right arrow to continue."
msgstr "\"Help\" ви задава въпроси, за да оправи дейността ви. Натиснете дясната стрелка, за да продължите."

#. A Tutorial page, from the left, about 160 pixels a line; a line break starts a new paragraph. The last paragraph says which key moves on.
msgctxt "tutorial.10"
msgid "To turn off your entertainment system, press the Off button.\nPress the Off button to continue."
msgstr "За да изключите системата си, натиснете бутона \"Off\".\nНатиснете \"Off\", за да продължите."

#. A Tutorial page, from the left, about 160 pixels a line; a line break starts a new paragraph. The last paragraph says which key moves on.
msgctxt "tutorial.11"
msgid "It's that easy!\nYou can now enjoy your entertainment system with one-touch Activity control.\nPress Exit now."
msgstr "Толкова е лесно!\nВече можете да управлявате системата си с едно докосване.\nНатиснете \"Изход\" сега."

#. The Tutorial's first page, above its words, in the large title font; about 160 pixels
msgctxt "tutorial.welcome"
msgid "Welcome!"
msgstr "Добре дошли!"

#. On the activity row the Tutorial pictures; about 100 pixels
msgctxt "tutorial.watch-tv"
msgid "Watch TV"
