#. On a button the Tutorial pictures: a button label, centred on a 81-pixel button; may wrap to two lines
msgctxt "tutorial.yes"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Да"

#. On a button the Tutorial pictures: a button label, centred on a 81-pixel button; may wrap to two lines
msgctxt "tutorial.no"
